      "changes": "Renumbered to Section 101 BNS. All 4 clauses of murder and all 5 statutory exceptions (Grave & Sudden Provocation, Private Defence exceeded in good faith, Public Servant exceeding powers, Sudden Fight without premeditation, Consent of adult above 18) are preserved with identical legal thresholds.",
