      "summary": "S. 115: Simple Hurt (imprisonment up to 1 year or fine up to Rs. 10,000 or community service). S. 117: Grievous Hurt (up to 7 years and fine; life if permanent disability caused).",
      "changes": "Community service is introduced as an alternative statutory punishment under Section 115(2) BNS for simple hurt. Section 117(3) introduces enhanced punishment of 10 years to life if grievous hurt results in permanent disability or persistent vegetative state.",
