      "changes": "Definition and punishment integrated into Section 356 BNS. All 10 historical exceptions (public truth, public conduct of servant, merits of public performance, fair court reports, good faith imputation) are preserved. Section 356(2) introduces Community Service as an alternative sentence alongside simple imprisonment up to 2 years or fine.",
