      "changes": "Colonial 'Sedition' (Rajdroh) is completely repealed from the statute book. It is replaced by Section 152 BNS targeting acts endangering sovereignty, unity and integrity of India (Deshdroh). Punishment is substantially increased from a minimum 3 years to minimum 7 years (up to life imprisonment). The Explanation explicitly protects legitimate political criticism, fair comments, and democratic opposition against government actions.",
