      "changes": "Old Section 309 IPC (punishing any attempt to commit suicide) is completely abolished, aligning criminal law with Section 115 of Mental Healthcare Act 2017. BNS Section 226 only penalizes suicide attempts made as a coercive weapon to blackmail or restrain public servants from performing their duty (simple imprisonment up to 1 year or community service).",
