      "changes": "Strict protection for women preserved (arrest only by female police officer; prohibited between sunset and sunrise except in exceptional circumstances with prior permission of JMIC). Crucial addition: Section 105 BNSS mandates that the process of conducting search, seizure, and arrest MUST be recorded through audio-video electronic means (e.g. mobile phone/body cam).",
