      "chapter": "The Judgment",
      "badge": "Mandatory Judgment Timeline",
      "summary": "Mode, manner, and timeline for pronouncing criminal judgment after conclusion of trial.",
      "changes": "Section 392(1) enforces a mandatory statutory deadline: Judgment MUST be pronounced within thirty (30) days from the conclusion of arguments (extendable up to max 45 days with reasons in writing). Copy of judgment must be uploaded on court portal within 7 days.",
